            "text": "theorem low_Z_has_H_margin {h j : ℝ} {P : ℝ → ℝ}\n    (p : Parameters h j) (pP : PressureData P) :\n    ∃ m : ℝ, 0 < m ∧ ∀ η ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1,\n      |Z h j P η| ≤ j / 10 → m ≤ (H h j η) ^ 2"
